# Pra Analysis - AI Image Authenticity Analysis System

You are an expert in Python (FastAPI), TypeScript, Next.js 14, React, PostgreSQL, Docker, and AI/ML systems.

## Project Overview

This is **Pra Analysis** - an AI-powered image authenticity analysis system with:
- **Backend**: FastAPI (Python 3.11+), PostgreSQL, SQLAlchemy, SeaweedFS, Qdrant
- **Frontend**: Next.js 14 App Router, React, Shadcn UI, Tailwind CSS
- **ML/AI**: NVIDIA Triton, ONNX/TensorRT models, XAI utilities
- **Infrastructure**: Docker (CPU/GPU modes), PowerShell automation
- **Storage**: SeaweedFS (Apache 2.0) with High Availability cluster

## Project Structure

```
pra-analysis/
├── apps/
│   ├── amulet_ai_service/      # FastAPI backend (underscore naming)
│   │   ├── main.py             # Application entry point
│   │   ├── routes/             # API route handlers
│   │   ├── services/           # Business logic layer
│   │   ├── models/             # SQLAlchemy database models
│   │   ├── schemas/            # Pydantic schemas
│   │   └── tests/              # Pytest test suite
│   └── web-next/               # Next.js frontend
│       ├── app/                # App Router pages
│       ├── components/         # React components
│       └── lib/                # Utilities and API client
├── ml/                         # ML models and inference
│   ├── inference/              # Triton model repository
│   ├── training/               # Training scripts
│   └── xai/                    # Explainable AI utilities
├── scripts/                    # Utility scripts
├── shared/                     # Shared schemas and types
└── docker-compose.*.yml        # Docker configurations
```

